  "about": "LaunchBox (and Big Box): the games in LaunchBox's Games folder, each platform's list in its Data folder, and the pictures, videos and manuals where LaunchBox looks for them. Close LaunchBox and Big Box first; the lists it had are set aside, so Undo puts them back.",
